5,1,1,talk,May,,I am tired of the same ideas resurfacing without checking the archives.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"We promise services, but the crews to run them are already stretched thin.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
