35,2,1,talk,May,,"The ferry pilot worked, but the late-evening pilot met its cost target.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,The late-turn pool is empty. Overtime covers both departures and works.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Midori,,"Audits show waiting for connections costs the most time, not ticketing.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Shizue,,Bidders price heavy contingency for pre-war shells due to unrecorded voids.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,"The capital ledger has a ring-fenced balance, but operating subsidies are trimmed.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,May,,"@Benjamin, if the pool is empty, extending night service is impossible.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@May, correct. The crews are a third below establishment.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Midori,,"@Shizue, so station upgrades are risky because of the hidden voids?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Midori, yes. Three jobs stopped for weeks. It is a delivery trap.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@May, the ferry pilot success suggests the fare platform is technically sound.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,May,,The accessibility programme records show lift rebuilds finished on time.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,The maintenance contract for lifts has spare capacity. That is good.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Midori,,"Timed runs show mid-city surface routes are slower, but platforms clear fine.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Shizue,,The committee minutes show ferry and rail back offices never agreed data terms.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,Ticketing fees exceed paving rates. We are paying too much for the old system.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
